# The Role and Design of Computer Studies in a Research-Oriented Translation Program.

**Authors:** Meyer, Ingrid

## Abstract
Notes the increasing use of computers by professional translators. Argues that instruction in translation systems should prepare students for both the receiving and production ends of machine translation systems. Discusses considerations for the design of computer translation studies. Includes a course outline from a computer translation seminar. (SG)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ449346

